    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Command cats. Control minds. Establish your Meow World Order.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow World Order</strong> is a darkly satirical idle-strategy game where you grow a powerful feline regime fueled by <strong>Meowfluence Points (MP)</strong>. Recruit adorable yet obedient cats and expose traitors lurking within your ranks\u2014all while crafting the ultimate kitty-powered dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to generate MP. Let your loyal cats earn it passively. Or sit back and watch as your feline empire runs itself\u2014unless, of course, a <strong>mole cat</strong> slips through undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click for instant MP, or build a passive economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy cats will infiltrate your army. Spot and eliminate them before they sabotage your regime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Polish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic depth scaling, floating ghost cats, breathing animations, and juicy UI feedback create a rich visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Cat Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat has a cost, a passive MP rate Deploy wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor &amp; Parody</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tongue-in-cheek critique of surveillance, propaganda, and totalitarianism\u2014told through cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a lone paw in the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You end as the Supreme Feline Leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obey the paw. Enforce the claw. Join the Meow World Order.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Command cats. Control minds. Establish your Meow World Order.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow World Order</strong> is a darkly satirical idle-strategy game where you grow a powerful feline regime fueled by <strong>Meowfluence Points (MP)</strong>. Recruit adorable yet obedient cats and expose traitors lurking within your ranks\u2014all while crafting the ultimate kitty-powered dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to generate MP. Let your loyal cats earn it passively. Or sit back and watch as your feline empire runs itself\u2014unless, of course, a <strong>mole cat</strong> slips through undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click for instant MP, or build a passive economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy cats will infiltrate your army. Spot and eliminate them before they sabotage your regime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Polish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic depth scaling, floating ghost cats, breathing animations, and juicy UI feedback create a rich visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Cat Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat has a cost, a passive MP rate Deploy wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor &amp; Parody</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tongue-in-cheek critique of surveillance, propaganda, and totalitarianism\u2014told through cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a lone paw in the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You end as the Supreme Feline Leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obey the paw. Enforce the claw. Join the Meow World Order.</strong></p>",
